                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If this were an early access game, I'd say that it was a fun little prototype with tons of potential.\nHowever, this is considered to be the finished product and I just can't recommend it.\nIn short, it's very buggy, very unbalanced, and very light on content. You'll be ridiculously overpowered after 10 minutes, and you'll have seen everything that the game has to offer after about an hour or so.\n\nIt's such a shame because the whole top down mining game concept works really well, playing this game can be addictive, fun and relaxing but you're just constantly reminded of how much better it could be with more time and effort spent.\n\nIf I were the dev, I'd pull this and either go into early access or work on it for a year or two until it's ready.",
